{"3669890": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Chronos Bound: How We Became Heroes", "steam_appid": 3669890, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chronos Bound is a modern 2.5D shoot ’em up where classic arcade intensity meets roguelite progression.</strong><br><br>A colossal orbital station is collapsing above Earth. Inside its corridors, metal, wreckage and organic matter have fused into grotesque enemy swarms. Pilot a lone ship, survive overwhelming attacks, and push deeper with every run.<br><br><strong>MASTER THE 360° SHIELD</strong><br>Aim your directional shield to block incoming fire, survive impossible patterns and create openings for counterattacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669890/extras/3e87f8f983d90ffbc71727c4e96dba97.poster.avif?t=1786644775\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669890/extras/3e87f8f983d90ffbc71727c4e96dba97.webm?t=1786644775\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669890/extras/3e87f8f983d90ffbc71727c4e96dba97.mp4?t=1786644775\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR SHIP EVERY RUN</strong><br>Unlock upgrades, adapt your loadout and experiment with new paths as each attempt makes you stronger and sharper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669890/extras/2d7bb9729367d1e0ee2dbeaf2fdede51.poster.avif?t=1786644775\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669890/extras/2d7bb9729367d1e0ee2dbeaf2fdede51.webm?t=1786644775\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669890/extras/2d7bb9729367d1e0ee2dbeaf2fdede51.mp4?t=1786644775\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CLASSIC SHMUP INTENSITY, MODERN PRESENTATION</strong><br>Fast side-scrolling combat, cinematic Unreal-powered environments, massive bosses and arcade replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669890/extras/e5d75f49174b047a822b5a86f82b3e6a.poster.avif?t=1786644775\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669890/extras/e5d75f49174b047a822b5a86f82b3e6a.webm?t=1786644775\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669890/extras/e5d75f49174b047a822b5a86f82b3e6a.mp4?t=1786644775\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong><br>- 2.5D side-scrolling shoot ’em up combat<br>- Roguelite upgrade progression<br>- 360° directional shield mechanic<br>- Grotesque sci-fi enemies born from wreckage and organic matter<br>- Massive boss fights and escalating challenge<br>- Designed for controller play, replayability and score attack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669890/extras/e59bfa739ee5d1fc4d90dd8fbaf35eaf.poster.avif?t=1786644775\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669890/extras/e59bfa739ee5d1